.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt PKCS8_ENCRYPT 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm PKCS8_decrypt ,
.Nm PKCS8_decrypt_ex ,
.Nm PKCS8_encrypt ,
.Nm PKCS8_encrypt_ex ,
.Nm PKCS8_set0_pbe ,
.Nm PKCS8_set0_pbe_ex
.Nd PKCS8 encrypt/decrypt functions
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/x509.h
.Ft PKCS8_PRIV_KEY_INFO *
.Fo PKCS8_decrypt
.Fa "const X509_SIG *p8"
.Fa "const char *pass"
.Fa "int passlen"
.Fc
.Ft PKCS8_PRIV_KEY_INFO *
.Fo PKCS8_decrypt_ex
.Fa "const X509_SIG *p8"
.Fa "const char *pass"
.Fa "int passlen"
.Fa "OSSL_LIB_CTX *ctx"
.Fa "const char *propq"
.Fc
.Ft X509_SIG *
.Fo PKCS8_encrypt
.Fa "int pbe_nid"
.Fa "const EVP_CIPHER *cipher"
.Fa "const char *pass"
.Fa "int passlen"
.Fa "unsigned char *salt"
.Fa "int saltlen"
.Fa "int iter"
.Fa "PKCS8_PRIV_KEY_INFO *p8"
.Fc
.Ft X509_SIG *
.Fo PKCS8_encrypt_ex
.Fa "int pbe_nid"
.Fa "const EVP_CIPHER *cipher"
.Fa "const char *pass"
.Fa "int passlen"
.Fa "unsigned char *salt"
.Fa "int saltlen"
.Fa "int iter"
.Fa "PKCS8_PRIV_KEY_INFO *p8"
.Fa "OSSL_LIB_CTX *ctx"
.Fa "const char *propq"
.Fc
.Ft X509_SIG *
.Fo PKCS8_set0_pbe
.Fa "const char *pass"
.Fa "int passlen"
.Fa "PKCS8_PRIV_KEY_INFO *p8inf"
.Fa "X509_ALGOR *pbe"
.Fc
.Ft X509_SIG *
.Fo PKCS8_set0_pbe_ex
.Fa "const char *pass"
.Fa "int passlen"
.Fa "PKCS8_PRIV_KEY_INFO *p8inf"
.Fa "X509_ALGOR *pbe"
.Fa "OSSL_LIB_CTX *ctx"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn PKCS8_encrypt
and
.Fn PKCS8_encrypt_ex
perform encryption of an object
.Fa p8
using the password
.Fa pass
of length
.Fa passlen ,
salt
.Fa salt
of length
.Fa saltlen
and iteration count
.Fa iter .
The resulting
.Vt X509_SIG
contains the encoded algorithm parameters and encrypted key.
.Pp
.Fn PKCS8_decrypt
and
.Fn PKCS8_decrypt_ex
perform decryption of an
.Vt X509_SIG
in
.Fa p8
using the password
.Fa pass
of length
.Fa passlen
along with algorithm parameters obtained from the
.Fa p8 .
.Pp
.Fn PKCS8_set0_pbe
and
.Fn PKCS8_set0_pbe_ex
perform encryption of the
.Fa p8inf
using the password
.Fa pass
of length
.Fa passlen
and parameters
.Fa pbe .
.Pp
Functions ending in
.Xr _ex 3
allow for a library context
.Fa ctx
and property query
.Fa propq
to be used to select algorithm implementations.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn PKCS8_encrypt ,
.Fn PKCS8_encrypt_ex ,
.Fn PKCS8_set0_pbe
and
.Fn PKCS8_set0_pbe_ex
return an encrypted key in a
.Vt X509_SIG
structure or NULL if an error occurs.
.Pp
.Fn PKCS8_decrypt
and
.Fn PKCS8_decrypt_ex
return a
.Vt PKCS8_PRIV_KEY_INFO
or NULL if an error occurs.
.Sh CONFORMING TO
IETF RFC 7292
.Pf ( Lk https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7292 )
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr crypto 7
.Sh HISTORY
.Fn PKCS8_decrypt_ex ,
.Fn PKCS8_encrypt_ex
and
.Fn PKCS8_set0_pbe_ex
were added in OpenSSL 3.0.
